IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `coa-core`

-- coa11-part16-ch2-general.l4: Companies Act 2006 (United Kingdom), Part 16 (Audit), Chapter 2 (Appointment of auditors),
-- the cross-heading "General provisions": ss 492 to 494A (with 494ZA): raw lines 6880-6969.
-- LAYER 1: the law, objectively; no seat, no point of view.  Reading a result, the polarity of names and inputs: as in
-- coa11-part16-ch1.l4.  ss 493 and 494 (powers to make regulations about the disclosure of the terms of an auditor's
-- appointment and of services and remuneration) are machinery, inert under reason 2, and have no declaration.
-- Every top-level name, type, constructor and field begins with the label of the provision it implements.

§ `Part 16 Chapter 2: Appointment of auditors: general provisions (ss 492 to 494A)`

§§ `s 492 Fixing of auditor's remuneration`

DECLARE `s 492 way the auditor was appointed` IS ONE OF
    `s 492 appointed by the members`
    `s 492 appointed by the directors`
    `s 492 appointed by the Secretary of State`
    `s 492 appointed in some other way`

DECLARE `s 492 who fixes the remuneration` IS ONE OF
    `s 492(1) the members, by ordinary resolution or in such manner as the members may by ordinary resolution determine`
    `s 492(2) the directors`
    `s 492(3) the Secretary of State`
    `s 492 not covered: the auditor was appointed in some other way`

-- src:6882 | (1) The remuneration of an auditor appointed by the members of a company must be fixed by the members by ordinary resolution or in such manner as the members may by ordinary resolution determine.
-- src:6883 | (2) The remuneration of an auditor appointed by the directors of a company must be fixed by the directors.
-- src:6884 | (3) The remuneration of an auditor appointed by the Secretary of State must be fixed by the Secretary of State.
@ref s 492(1) to (3) Who fixes the remuneration of an auditor (src:6882-6884)
GIVEN way IS A `s 492 way the auditor was appointed`
GIVETH A `s 492 who fixes the remuneration`
`s 492(1) to (3) who must fix the auditor's remuneration` MEANS
    CONSIDER way
    WHEN `s 492 appointed by the members` THEN `s 492(1) the members, by ordinary resolution or in such manner as the members may by ordinary resolution determine`
    WHEN `s 492 appointed by the directors` THEN `s 492(2) the directors`
    WHEN `s 492 appointed by the Secretary of State` THEN `s 492(3) the Secretary of State`
    WHEN `s 492 appointed in some other way` THEN `s 492 not covered: the auditor was appointed in some other way` -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the section names three ways of appointment and no other

-- src:6885 | (4) For the purposes of this section “remuneration” includes sums paid in respect of expenses.
@ref s 492(4) "remuneration" includes sums paid in respect of expenses (src:6885-6885)
GIVEN `the sum is paid in respect of expenses` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 492(4) the sum is part of the auditor's remuneration` MEANS
    IF `the sum is paid in respect of expenses`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "“remuneration” includes sums paid in respect of expenses" does not say what else it includes

-- src:6886 | (5) This section applies in relation to benefits in kind as to payments of money.
@ref s 492(5) This section applies in relation to benefits in kind as to payments of money (src:6886-6886)
GIVEN `the benefit is a benefit in kind` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 492(5) the section applies to the benefit as to a payment of money` MEANS
    IF `the benefit is a benefit in kind`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "This section applies in relation to benefits in kind as to payments of money" says nothing of any other thing

-- ss 493 (Disclosure of terms of audit appointment) and 494 (Disclosure of services provided by auditor or associates and related
-- remuneration): regulation-making powers and the procedure for them, inert under reason 2 (machinery).

§§ `s 494ZA The maximum engagement period`

-- The company's financial years are supplied as a list in date order: the first element is the first financial year of the
-- maximum engagement period (the first of the consecutive years in which the person is auditor of the company), and the list goes
-- on past the cut-off the Table names.  An answer is NOTHING until the list reaches a year beginning on or after the cut-off,
-- because the "last financial year of the company to begin before / within ..." cannot be identified from years not yet supplied.
-- src:6921 | 494ZA The maximum engagement period
-- src:6922 | (1) Where a person is auditor of a company for consecutive financial years, the maximum engagement period of the person as auditor of the company—
-- src:6923 | (a) begins with the first of those years (see the appropriate entry in the first column of the following Table), and
-- src:6924 | (b) ends with the financial year specified in the corresponding entry in the second column of the Table:
-- src:6925 | First financial year of the maximum engagement period | Last financial year of the maximum engagement period
@ref s 494ZA(1) The Table (src:6921-6925)
DECLARE `s 494ZA financial year` HAS
    `s 494ZA first day of the financial year` IS A DATE
    `s 494ZA last day of the financial year` IS A DATE
    `s 494ZA the auditor was appointed for the year following a qualifying selection procedure` IS A BOOLEAN

-- src:6925 | First financial year of the maximum engagement period | Last financial year of the maximum engagement period
-- src:6926 | A financial year of the company beginning before 17 June 1994 | The last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2020.
-- src:6927 | A financial year of the company beginning—(a) on or after 17 June 1994, and(b) before 17 June 2003 | The last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2023.
-- src:6928 | A financial year of the company beginning—(a) on or after 17 June 2003, and(b) before 17 June 2016 | No qualifying selection procedureWhere neither the first financial year of the maximum engagement period nor any subsequent financial year is one for which the auditor has been appointed following the carrying out of a qualifying selection procedure, the later of-(a) the last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2016, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.No qualifying selection procedure within 10 yearsWhere the last day of the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure is before 17 June 2016—(a) the last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2016, unless(b) the auditor is appointed following a qualifying selection procedure for the first financial year of the company to begin on or after 17 June 2016, in which case it is the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.Qualifying selection procedure within 10 yearsIn any other case, the earlier of-(a) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.
-- src:6929 | A financial year of the company beginning on or after 17 June 2016 | The earlier of—(a) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.
@ref s 494ZA(1) The Table: the last financial year of the company to begin before a day (src:6925-6929)
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
      years IS A LIST OF `s 494ZA financial year`
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 494ZA financial year`
`s 494ZA the last financial year of the company to begin before the day` MEANS
    IF any (GIVEN year YIELD year's `s 494ZA first day of the financial year` AT LEAST `the day`) years
    THEN `s 494ZA the last one of the years` (filter (GIVEN year YIELD year's `s 494ZA first day of the financial year` LESS THAN `the day`) years)
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the years supplied do not reach the day, so the last year to begin before it cannot yet be identified

-- src:6925 | First financial year of the maximum engagement period | Last financial year of the maximum engagement period
-- src:6926 | A financial year of the company beginning before 17 June 1994 | The last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2020.
-- src:6927 | A financial year of the company beginning—(a) on or after 17 June 1994, and(b) before 17 June 2003 | The last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2023.
-- src:6928 | A financial year of the company beginning—(a) on or after 17 June 2003, and(b) before 17 June 2016 | No qualifying selection procedureWhere neither the first financial year of the maximum engagement period nor any subsequent financial year is one for which the auditor has been appointed following the carrying out of a qualifying selection procedure, the later of-(a) the last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2016, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.No qualifying selection procedure within 10 yearsWhere the last day of the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure is before 17 June 2016—(a) the last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2016, unless(b) the auditor is appointed following a qualifying selection procedure for the first financial year of the company to begin on or after 17 June 2016, in which case it is the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.Qualifying selection procedure within 10 yearsIn any other case, the earlier of-(a) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.
-- src:6929 | A financial year of the company beginning on or after 17 June 2016 | The earlier of—(a) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.
@ref s 494ZA(1) The Table: the last financial year of the company to begin within a period of years (src:6925-6929)
GIVEN `the first day of the period` IS A DATE
      `the number of years` IS A NUMBER
      years IS A LIST OF `s 494ZA financial year`
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 494ZA financial year`
`s 494ZA the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of years beginning with the day` MEANS
    IF any (GIVEN year YIELD year's `s 494ZA first day of the financial year` AT LEAST `the end of the period`) years
    THEN `s 494ZA the last one of the years` (filter (GIVEN year YIELD (year's `s 494ZA first day of the financial year` AT LEAST `the first day of the period`) AND (year's `s 494ZA first day of the financial year` LESS THAN `the end of the period`)) years)
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the years supplied do not reach the end of the period, so the last year to begin within it cannot yet be identified
    WHERE
        -- "the period of 10 years beginning with the first day": that day up to, but not including, its tenth anniversary
        `the end of the period` MEANS `add years` `the first day of the period` `the number of years`

-- src:6925 | First financial year of the maximum engagement period | Last financial year of the maximum engagement period
-- src:6926 | A financial year of the company beginning before 17 June 1994 | The last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2020.
-- src:6927 | A financial year of the company beginning—(a) on or after 17 June 1994, and(b) before 17 June 2003 | The last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2023.
-- src:6928 | A financial year of the company beginning—(a) on or after 17 June 2003, and(b) before 17 June 2016 | No qualifying selection procedureWhere neither the first financial year of the maximum engagement period nor any subsequent financial year is one for which the auditor has been appointed following the carrying out of a qualifying selection procedure, the later of-(a) the last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2016, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.No qualifying selection procedure within 10 yearsWhere the last day of the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure is before 17 June 2016—(a) the last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2016, unless(b) the auditor is appointed following a qualifying selection procedure for the first financial year of the company to begin on or after 17 June 2016, in which case it is the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.Qualifying selection procedure within 10 yearsIn any other case, the earlier of-(a) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.
-- src:6929 | A financial year of the company beginning on or after 17 June 2016 | The earlier of—(a) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.
@ref s 494ZA(1) The Table: the last of a list of financial years (src:6925-6929)
GIVEN years IS A LIST OF `s 494ZA financial year`
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 494ZA financial year`
`s 494ZA the last one of the years` MEANS
    CONSIDER years
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): no year of the company begins in that period
    WHEN year FOLLOWED BY rest THEN
        CONSIDER `s 494ZA the last one of the years` rest
        WHEN NOTHING THEN JUST year
        WHEN JUST later THEN JUST later

-- src:6925 | First financial year of the maximum engagement period | Last financial year of the maximum engagement period
-- src:6926 | A financial year of the company beginning before 17 June 1994 | The last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2020.
-- src:6927 | A financial year of the company beginning—(a) on or after 17 June 1994, and(b) before 17 June 2003 | The last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2023.
-- src:6928 | A financial year of the company beginning—(a) on or after 17 June 2003, and(b) before 17 June 2016 | No qualifying selection procedureWhere neither the first financial year of the maximum engagement period nor any subsequent financial year is one for which the auditor has been appointed following the carrying out of a qualifying selection procedure, the later of-(a) the last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2016, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.No qualifying selection procedure within 10 yearsWhere the last day of the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure is before 17 June 2016—(a) the last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2016, unless(b) the auditor is appointed following a qualifying selection procedure for the first financial year of the company to begin on or after 17 June 2016, in which case it is the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.Qualifying selection procedure within 10 yearsIn any other case, the earlier of-(a) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.
-- src:6929 | A financial year of the company beginning on or after 17 June 2016 | The earlier of—(a) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.
@ref s 494ZA(1) The Table: the first financial year of the company to begin on or after a day (src:6925-6929)
GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
      years IS A LIST OF `s 494ZA financial year`
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 494ZA financial year`
`s 494ZA the first financial year of the company to begin on or after the day` MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN year YIELD year's `s 494ZA first day of the financial year` AT LEAST `the day`) years
    WHEN EMPTY THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the years supplied do not reach the day
    WHEN year FOLLOWED BY rest THEN JUST year

-- src:6925 | First financial year of the maximum engagement period | Last financial year of the maximum engagement period
-- src:6926 | A financial year of the company beginning before 17 June 1994 | The last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2020.
-- src:6927 | A financial year of the company beginning—(a) on or after 17 June 1994, and(b) before 17 June 2003 | The last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2023.
-- src:6928 | A financial year of the company beginning—(a) on or after 17 June 2003, and(b) before 17 June 2016 | No qualifying selection procedureWhere neither the first financial year of the maximum engagement period nor any subsequent financial year is one for which the auditor has been appointed following the carrying out of a qualifying selection procedure, the later of-(a) the last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2016, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.No qualifying selection procedure within 10 yearsWhere the last day of the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure is before 17 June 2016—(a) the last financial year of the company to begin before 17 June 2016, unless(b) the auditor is appointed following a qualifying selection procedure for the first financial year of the company to begin on or after 17 June 2016, in which case it is the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.Qualifying selection procedure within 10 yearsIn any other case, the earlier of-(a) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.
-- src:6929 | A financial year of the company beginning on or after 17 June 2016 | The earlier of—(a) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 10 years beginning with the first day of the last financial year of the company for which the auditor was appointed following a qualifying selection procedure, and(b) the last financial year of the company to begin within the period of 20 years beginning with the first day of the first financial year of the maximum engagement period.
@ref s 494ZA(1) The Table: the later of two financial years (src:6925-6929)
GIVEN one IS A MAYBE `s 494ZA financial year`
      other IS A MAYBE `s 494ZA financial year`
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 494ZA financial year`
`s 494ZA the later of the two years` MEANS
    CONSIDER one
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): a year the Table asks for cannot yet be identified
    WHEN JUST first THEN
        CONSIDER other
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): a year the Table asks for cannot yet be identified
        WHEN JUST second THEN
            IF first's `s 494ZA first day of the financial year` AT LEAST second's `s 494ZA first day of the financial year`
            THEN JUST first
            ELSE JUST second

